WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.835 --> 00:00:36.129
Eddy rolled onto the school lot.

2
00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:40.810
His tires were new.

3
00:00:40.811 --> 00:00:44.474
His dumper was clean.

4
00:00:44.475 --> 00:00:47.824
"Oh boy!" said Eddy.

5
00:00:47.825 --> 00:00:50.675
"My first day of school!"

6
00:00:50.676 --> 00:00:53.573
Eddy looked at the big garage.

7
00:00:53.574 --> 00:00:58.008
A sign read Tire Town School.

8
00:00:58.009 --> 00:01:02.382
"Beep, beep!" said a long car.

9
00:01:02.383 --> 00:01:04.438
"You're in my way!"

10
00:01:04.439 --> 00:01:10.843
Eddy moved.

11
00:01:10.844 --> 00:01:13.627
Vroom! Vroom!

12
00:01:13.628 --> 00:01:16.589
"Look out!" said a fast car.

13
00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:18.901
Eddy jumped.

14
00:01:18.902 --> 00:01:22.769
"Move!" said a big truck.

15
00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:27.797
"Sorry!" said Eddy.

16
00:01:27.798 --> 00:01:30.882
Eddy parked near some tires.

17
00:01:30.883 --> 00:01:35.313
Fast cars and trucks zoomed by.

18
00:01:35.314 --> 00:01:42.132
Eddy sighed.

19
00:01:42.133 --> 00:01:46.102
"I wish I was fast," he thought.

20
00:01:46.103 --> 00:01:49.036
"Hello!" called a voice.

21
00:01:49.037 --> 00:01:51.870
Eddy turned around.

22
00:01:51.871 --> 00:01:55.168
He saw a funny car.

23
00:01:55.169 --> 00:01:58.805
She had bright colors.

24
00:01:58.806 --> 00:02:01.420
She had a big grin.

25
00:02:01.421 --> 00:02:04.919
"I'm Poppy," said the car.

26
00:02:04.920 --> 00:02:09.121
"Want to see something funny?"
